Script: app/scripts/step13-pipeline-live-proof.mts (deleted after use)
Signer: raw-key. 4 fresh generated addresses, a real 3-party cycle A->B->C->A (1,000,000 base
units each) plus one dangling invoice D->E (400,000 base units, no cycle reaches it).

All 4 real registrations landed:
